        "display_name": null,
        "comment": "Static loader scope, 2026-10-25 UTC. SHA-256 verified; complete 2,367-byte Bash script. It declares anonymous FTP delivery from 208.87.241.147 on port 21 for 13 named onyx architecture files: x86, mips, x86_64, i686, mpsl, arm, arm5, arm6, arm7, ppc, m68k, sh4 and spc. Each block attempts a download, copies the named file to a common onyx pathname, changes permissions and attempts to run that pathname. Port 21 is declared payload delivery, not evidence of a C2 channel; these statements are compiled script intent, not successful observed transfers. The named payloads were not fetched, their hashes/family and current availability remain unknown, and the script was not executed. The upstream wraith tag is retained as source metadata without inferring a payload family from names alone. Review hold retained pending stronger payload/context evidence; no speculative URLhaus or ThreatFox submission. No credentials, raw script content or malware bytes are included in this analysis comment."
